She points to IG’s decision in 2011, immediately after the floor was introduced by the central bank, to[ remove] its[ offering of guaranteed] stop[ orders in] relation[ to EUR]CH[F trades], indicating that IG knew that the events that occurred on 15 January could be a possibility.
